Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So now our whole company is owned by\Nthis Darts guy. I don't get it, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,how was one person able to buy every\Nsingle share of kaiba corp without
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.17,0:01:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you and i knowing about it our network\Nshould have detected it there's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,only one way that i can think of they\Nmust have hacked into our accounts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you knowing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd they get past your security system?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're obviously dealing with\Na powerful organization here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.69,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But, sir... Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.35,0:01:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your boss anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.39,0:01:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Seto...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.85,0:01:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't abandon you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stand by your side until\NKaiba Corp is yours again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That goes for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.29,0:01:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,See, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all with ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we waiting for? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.63,0:01:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get to the museum\Nand decipher those ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My research team is already there,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:02:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and my security force will\Nhandle any unexpected guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.13,0:02:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost done!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.83,0:02:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone must have found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.41,0:02:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, emergency message on the red line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.73,0:02:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be just what I'm waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we're ready to upload the\Nimages of the Undersea Ruins
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So that was your plan.\NYou made sure your team
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,got there before darts\NWhat did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, you know my brother's\Nalways one step ahead of everyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Receiving data
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if we cut it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.03,0:02:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't touch that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them. Oh well. Well, at\Nleast we got what we needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the images, and my grandpa's\Nlooking them over now. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet up as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and one more thing. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.95,0:03:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, you can't blame the\NPharaoh for what happened to Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.99,0:03:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's far too much at\Nstake for hard feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.61,0:03:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we're all fighting a common\Nenemy, and this data may be our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.23,0:03:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, the quality of the images\Nis much worse than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.13,0:03:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the carvings have been worn away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we clear up these photos, I\Nwon't be able to read much at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Set a course for Kaiba Corporation\Nheadquarters immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.71,0:03:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts and his gang must have\Ntaken over the place by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way we can process these images\Nfast enough is by using my computer system,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,so we have no choice. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.05,0:03:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has a good point, Joey. He does?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,First they took Pegasus away, and now\Nthey've taken over Kaiba's company,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,which means we've got to stop these\Ncriminals before they make their next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And we have no time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're more gung-ho than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, since you\Nlost your title and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.63,0:04:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, this fight is about so much more\Nthan a mere championship dueling title.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.01,0:04:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,People are getting hurt and\Nthe whole world's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get tired of\Nmaking the same speech
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,every time you're faced with a challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop saving the world and get a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, we'll meet you two at the pier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.11,0:04:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,10-4. We'll see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Those lights are getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.97,0:05:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, after 10,000 years in exile,\Nthe mighty Leviathan is ready to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order to reach his full potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.15,0:05:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,there are several souls\Nthat must still be offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.23,0:05:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look, Raphael
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend wasn't careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair, don't sound so displeased. He's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Better off where he is\Nnow. Alistair's energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,along with our other prisoners,\Nwill fuel the great beast
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh and his\Nfriends will be arriving
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,shortly I trust you'll\Ngive them a warm welcome?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't escape me this time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, then, on to phase two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Each glimmer of light\Nmust join to become whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.49,0:06:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Each soul must be utilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then can the Leviathan cross over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient soldiers of the\NOrichalcos, hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.35,0:06:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Locate the scattered pieces\Nof the Great Leviathan
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Inhabit these crystals,\Nand return to this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.99,0:06:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,for the Battle of Atlantis begins again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night! Cheerio!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What have we got here? A stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, guess someone dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's worth anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my Oricalcus soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Scatter your forces to the\Nfar corners of the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and deliver to me all\Nthe souls you can gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:08:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, time to prepare a welcoming party\Nfor the so-called Chosen Duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Take those two to the medical\Ncenter I'm feeling generous Right
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, guys Stay safe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor I'm glad\Nyou're all right. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how was the road trip guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.99,0:09:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Could have been better We hit a pretty\Nbig snag on the way flat tire We ran
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.19,0:09:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,into my and one of those freaks the\None that jumped in and ended your duel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk he's really got it in for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,man, and I'm afraid my\Nstill on their side, too
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait till I find them
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.85,0:09:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, any word yet on Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.79,0:09:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't get him back,\NI'll never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, we need him to fight these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.77,0:09:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And I promise I will rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.25,0:09:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But I need to pay a little\Nvisit to Kyber Corp first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need some tech support. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't some kind of field trip, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess you can tag along if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.17,0:10:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, geeks,\Nbut I have a company to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.01,0:10:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So whoever's coming with me, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.07,0:10:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, and be careful. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Taya, we better tell\Nthe police what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The way this is heading, we're going\Nto need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, try to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.03,0:10:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we going, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.01,0:10:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an underground passage to my central\Ncomputer designed for emergencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.81,0:10:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Access granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if Darts' brute squad is guarding\Nthe area, they'll never see us go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No one messes with my company\Nand gets away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that was, and\NI'm not staying to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.07,0:11:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.19,0:11:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you realize these monsters\Naren't holograms, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're suggesting that we're\Nsurrounded by real monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.67,0:11:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you're as insane as the lunatics\Nwho took over Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,These things can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.11,0:11:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They are, believe me. Somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.01,0:11:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,a doorway has been opened up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and monsters from a parallel\Nuniverse have entered into our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you've got a better explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're nuts, but this\Nisn't the best time to argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.61,0:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.05,0:11:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We've nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.01,0:11:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you start over and this time try
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,telling the truth don't\Nyou understand that is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.11,0:12:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the truth there's a\Nmotorcycle gang going around
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,stealing people's souls\Nwith a magic card you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,kids watch too many\Ncartoons we're serious these
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.39,0:12:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,guys are trying to take\Nover the whole world
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.57,0:12:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,really tell me something\Nyoung man this so-called
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Gang, do they wear a symbol like\Nthis? On three, Taya. Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.57,0:12:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.03,0:12:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing that dueled\Nagainst the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,On three? Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I call forth my obnoxious Celtic guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.31,0:12:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Force Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:12:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.81,0:13:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Through here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Denied! Denied! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.05,0:13:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone must have reprogrammed the code!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trapped, and our monsters are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Need some help, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know how you did it, but you\Nhacked into Kaiba Corp's security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I tagged along\Non Kaiba's field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're undoing what those guys did?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.49,0:13:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That should slow them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's the basic idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.33,0:14:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,when this mess is finally over, let me\Nknow if you want me to upgrade your system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad news, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.63,0:14:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't access the central computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Corp's mainframe's\Non a separate system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.89,0:14:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be able to\Nenhance those photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating retinal check, scanning subject,\Nuser authorized, Seto Kaiba confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Voice recognition set.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut down the old system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.53,0:14:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Reboot with backup system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Affirmative, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin analyzing images,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.47,0:14:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,reference every inscription,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.39,0:14:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and cross-reference with every\Nknown archaeological database.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:14:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it say, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.41,0:15:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,After its 10,000-year-long slumber,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.43,0:15:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,the Black Serpent will swallow the sun\Nand then Paradise will rule once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Professor,\Nbut what's it all mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This paradise it speaks\Nof must be Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.21,0:15:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That insignia looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.39,0:15:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have I seen that before?\NWait a sec. It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't be what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The symbol of a secret financial\Norganization known as Paradis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's ever seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But rumor has it they control a small\Npiece of every company in the world. Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It is them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, the president of Paradis, is darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.69,0:15:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know what we're up against!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.51,0:15:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.65,0:15:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the stranger from my vision!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought against Ironheart in\Nthe ancient Battle of Atlantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:16:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How can the same man who\Nfought a war 10,000 years
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,ago be the president of\Na modern-day corporation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I just lost my link! Quick, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.65,0:16:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the headquarters of this paradis?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.17,0:16:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, you creeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a plant first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.51,0:16:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you're so close yet so
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,very far gentlemen thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.23,0:16:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,for coming to me you've made
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.07,0:16:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,my job so
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,much easier mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber and the infamous\NPharaoh, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed you two would have\Nfigured That out by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.09,0:16:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you are the\Nchosen duelists, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.27,0:17:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to prove anything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give me back my\Ncompany before I get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And return the souls you took.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.45,0:17:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else what, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.35,0:17:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it looks to me like you're\Nin no position to make demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then I'll make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.45,0:17:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel us, and if we win, you'll\Nrelease your prisoners at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We've summoned Timaeus and Krius!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.47,0:17:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the legendary dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.59,0:17:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Timaeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that eye of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.05,0:17:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The ancient battle continues, my friends,\Nand soon your souls will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.15,0:17:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.83,0:17:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, get ready to jump. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let him take\Nmy company apart. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.77,0:18:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.77,0:18:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we have bigger\Nthings to worry about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Valon. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh's friends\Nare heading your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, then it's time for me to\Nshow Joey Wheeler who's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.15,0:19:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Valon, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta prove meself to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.61,0:19:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, here comes Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And there he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.93,0:19:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's heading straight\Nfor the zombie patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.53,0:19:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go warn the others, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Dots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not leaving without Yugi and Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
